{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他接着做眼前该做的事，久违的昂扬又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"久违的昂扬\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己每次尽力都得改变一切，能做多少就先做到多少。\",\n      \"key\": \"每次尽力\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得那种不必时时防备的生活，也愿为自己真心爱惜的一切负责，所以继续做眼前该做的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心爱惜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"想到争取仍可能伤到那种生活，他心里又晃了一下，还是带着不安按自己的决定往前做。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里又晃了一下\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留继续行动后昂扬回来；不再等待无损办法已由S11-6承接，带着不安行动则落在S12-4，避免与R64重复总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不要求每次努力都证明自己能改变一切，改成他按眼下能做的分量尽力，也不再逼自己必须扭转所有事情。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\", \"R63\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确他舍不得的是不必时时防备的生活，也愿为真心爱惜的一切负责。牵挂成为继续承担的理由，怕伤到它的顾虑则在S12-4具体出现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"不替他宣布决心更踏实，而写出想到行动可能伤到所爱时仍带着不安按自己的决定往前做，保留不必等犹疑消失才坚定的意思，同时补足B3短暂摇摆的具体前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f1caee5f-5d85-4233-a5d1-828b44b85073", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003439805867Z", "elapsed_seconds": 165.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:37:25.394965+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ad63f1d124a21566f6b338dce8e3933b79d32719a288e44cc46def8629b4a3b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "scr